
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Habeeba & Al Rashid | Nikah Invitation</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,500;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--dark:#19140f;--gold:#d0b45e;--cream:#f4eddd;--muted:#a49a8b}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:#382b20;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif}
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:#19140ff5;color:var(--gold);padding:17px 22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-style:italic;font-size:21px}
nav a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none;font:10px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;margin-left:13px}
section{padding:70px 25px}
.dark{background:var(--dark);color:var(--cream)}
.light{background:var(--cream);color:#382b20}
.eyebrow{font:10px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:5px;color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:2}
h1{font-size:clamp(46px,12vw,78px);line-height:.98;margin:24px 0;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:-2px}
h2{font-size:clamp(34px,8vw,48px);line-height:1.1;margin:18px 0 28px;font-weight:600}
h2 em{font-weight:400}
p{line-height:1.85}
.hero{padding:0 0 55px}
.hero-art{min-height:390px;background:linear-gradient(0deg,#19140f 0%,#19140f08 65%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%,#74634a,#29221b 65%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero-art .monogram{position:absolute;top:25px;left:25px;font-size:21px;font-style:italic;color:#f0dfae}
.couple{font-size:100px;filter:grayscale(.3);text-shadow:0 12px 35px #000}
.hero-copy{padding:40px 28px 0}
blockquote{border-left:2px solid var(--gold);margin:28px 0;padding:5px 18px;color:#cbb77b;font-style:italic;line-height:2}
.subline{color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;letter-spacing:2px}
.date-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid #54462b;margin-top:35px}
.date-grid div{text-align:center;padding:15px 3px;border-right:1px solid #54462b}
.date-grid div:last-child{border:0}
.date-grid strong{display:block;font-size:19px;color:var(--cream)}
.date-grid span{font:9px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold)}
.countdown{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin:28px 0}
.countdown div{flex:1;max-width:90px;border:1px solid #4d402b;padding:14px 3px;text-align:center}
.countdown strong{display:block;color:var(--gold);font-size:25px}
.countdown small{font:9px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted)}
.detail-card{border:1px solid #dfd2ba;border-radius:20px;padding:25px 20px;margin-top:35px}
.detail-row{display:flex;gap:17px;padding:19px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfd2ba}
.detail-row:last-child{border:0}
.symbol{background:#eee5d1;border-radius:14px;padding:13px;height:50px;min-width:50px;text-align:center}
.label{font:10px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;color:#a28a4b}
.detail-row h3{font-size:19px;margin:6px 0}
.detail-row p{margin:3px 0;color:#8b8174}
.btn{display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;padding:18px 12px;margin-top:14px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#8f6b17,#cfb14e);color:white;font:10px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;letter-spacing:4px;border-radius:12px}
.btn.outline{background:transparent;color:#8e7433;border:1px solid #dfd2ba}
.family-card{border:1px solid #4a3d2a;padding:28px 25px;margin:28px 0}
.family-card h3{font-size:29px;margin:15px 0}
.family-card p{color:#aaa094}
.family-card strong{color:var(--cream);font-size:18px;font-weight:400}
.separator{text-align:center;color:var(--gold);font-size:30px;padding:10px}
.blessing{text-align:center}
.portrait{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e8dcc7,#b6a58b);border-radius:18px;min-height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:95px;margin:35px 0 20px}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:20px 4px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #d7c9b1;background:transparent;font:italic 18px 'Playfair Display',serif;color:#382b20;outline:none}
textarea{min-height:130px;resize:vertical}
button{width:100%;padding:20px;background:var(--dark);border:0;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:5px;font:11px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;margin-top:28px;cursor:pointer}
.wish{background:#fffaf2;border:1px solid #e3d8c5;padding:23px;margin:20px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.wish h3{font-style:italic;font-size:24px;margin:0 0 12px}
.wish p{color:#847a6e}
footer{text-align:center;background:var(--dark);color:var(--gold);padding:35px 20px;font-size:14px}
@media(min-width:700px){section{padding:85px max(10%,calc((100% - 760px)/2))}.hero-copy{max-width:760px;margin:auto}.hero-art{min-height:550px}.portrait{min-height:450px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <div class="logo">H &amp; R</div>
  <div>
    <a href="#details">DETAILS</a>
    <a href="#family">FAMILY</a>
    <a href="#wishes">WISHES</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero dark">
  <div class="hero-art">
    <div class="monogram">H &amp; R</div>
    <div class="couple" aria-label="Bride and groom illustration">🤵🏻‍♂️💍👰🏻‍♀️</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow">Nikah Invitation · 2026</div>
    <blockquote>
      “And He put between you affection and mercy.”<br>
      — Quran [30:21]
    </blockquote>
    <h1>Habeeba<br><span style="font-size:30px;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:5px">weds</span><br>Al Rashid</h1>
    <p class="subline">Together is the most beautiful place to be.</p>
    <div class="date-grid">
      <div><strong>THU</strong><span>DAY</span></div>
      <div><strong>24</strong><span>DATE</span></div>
      <div><strong>DEC</strong><span>MONTH</span></div>
